  dir_addresdata_err_key.pcpp - break step of dir_addresdata.pcpp:
  the key is empty (SM0119: a key needs at least one character and no
  control characters)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_addresdata_err_key.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_addresdata_err_key.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
